    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Showing up with prayer, showing up with\npatience, showing up with",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4665280,
    "dDurationMs": 8560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "self-sacrifice, showing up with a whole\nlot of persistence and perseverance.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4672080,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You don't protect your marriage by just\nsaying, \"I do.\" at the altar. You",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4676640,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "protect it every day by choosing love\neven when it's hard.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4681520,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e By listening when you would rather walk\naway,",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4685199,
    "dDurationMs": 8881,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e and by forgiving\neven when you feel justified not to.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4691520,
    "dDurationMs": 9679,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not just the big romantic gestures\nthat make a marriage strong. It's the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4696719,
    "dDurationMs": 11121,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small everyday decisions to love, to\nserve, and to stay connected that really",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4704800,
    "dDurationMs": 9439,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hold you together.\nAnd the home is healthiest when it is",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4711280,
    "dDurationMs": 8720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Christ centered.\nThe wisdom writer said it this way.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4717040,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A cord of two strands is easily pulled\napart, but a cord of three is not easily",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4724159,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "broken.\n\u003e\u003e What is that third element in the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4727520,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relationship? And that's any\nrelationship, but the third element in",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4731199,
    "dDurationMs": 5921,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that relationship when when you are\nserving Christ,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4734800,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e that third element is Christ.\n\u003e\u003e And he's the glue that keeps it",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4739199,
    "dDurationMs": 6721,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together. Amen. That's why we have to\nstay not just connected to one another,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4743679,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but connected to Christ. So the home is\nhealthiest when it is Christ centered.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4748239,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jesus didn't just describe marriage in\nterms of chores or responsibilities or",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4752960,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bills or kids or careers or work. He\ntalks about oneness, a unity that",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4759360,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reflects the heart of God.\nThat's why he says that the marital",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4763840,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relationship is supposed to be a\nreflection or a testimony to the world",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4768239,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the relationship between Christ, the\nbridegroom, and the church, his bride,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4775120,
    "dDurationMs": 9039,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that unity that is there. Amen. But\nhere's where we often drift. Instead of",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4780960,
    "dDurationMs": 11199,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Christ being the center of our home, we\nsubtly start um orbiting our lives",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4788960,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the kids' school and sports\nevents and job promotions and financial",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4794880,
    "dDurationMs": 9120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goals and buying houses and upgrading\nhouses and buying cars and that becomes",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4801199,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the central focus. And while none of\nthose things are necessarily bad in",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4805520,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "themselves, when they become central,\nwhen they become the priority,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4810640,
    "dDurationMs": 7519,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's when the relationship begins to\nstrain instead of being strengthened. A",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4816480,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pastor once counseledled a young couple\nwho said, \"We feel like business",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4820159,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "partners raising employees\nrather than a married couple with a",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4825679,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "family. Between piano lessons, soccer\ngames, PTA meetings, work emails, they",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4831120,
    "dDurationMs": 7119,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had lost each other.\nwhen they began scheduling again",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4835199,
    "dDurationMs": 8801,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intentional time together, morning\nprayer together, monthly date nights,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4841440,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "serving in ministry and church together,\nside by side. They rediscovered their",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4846400,
    "dDurationMs": 8319,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "friendship, their intimacy, their fun,\nand their purpose. One of their kids",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4852400,
    "dDurationMs": 8960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "later told them, \"I'm so glad you and\ndad like each other again.\"",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4858239,
    "dDurationMs": 8321,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kid notice. Kids notice\n\u003e\u003e when there's love in the air or when",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4863760,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not. Amen.\nParenting is indeed time consuming, but",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4869520,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if we are not careful, we'll put all our\nemotional energy into the kids and leave",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4873520,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing for the spouse. Let me tell you\nthis.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4877360,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we're following God's design, you got\nmarried before you had kids.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4882480,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the goal is that you will still be\nmarried when those kids go off to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4886719,
    "dDurationMs": 8161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "college, when they get married, when\nthey have their That's the goal. Amen.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4891760,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sometimes between having kids and\nthe kids going off, we can get so",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4897040,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "consumed with the kids and let it put so\nmuch pressure on the relationship with",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4902480,
    "dDurationMs": 9199,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your spouse that you lose the marriage.\nThat's not God's desire. It's not God's",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4908480,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "design. And truly providing for a family\nis costly and it's a big responsibility.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4914320,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But beware lest you spend so much time\nworking to give your kids all the things",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4920159,
    "dDurationMs": 8641,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you think they need and all the things\nmaybe that you didn't have, but in the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4925600,
    "dDurationMs": 9039,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "end you lose your marriage and your\nkids.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4930480,
    "dDurationMs": 8199,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oftentimes I think kids need less stuff\nand they need more of you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4940320,
    "dDurationMs": 9520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a smaller house,\na smaller TV, a smaller everything.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4947199,
    "dDurationMs": 7841,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But you spend time with your kids.\n\u003e\u003e Amen. That's what's most important.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4952960,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e They are the only things from this life\nthat you can take to eternity with you",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4956960,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cuz the house is going to be left, the\nTV is going to be left, everything else",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4961199,
    "dDurationMs": 7201,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is going to be left. But if you've built\na strong relationship with your kids and",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4965920,
    "dDurationMs": 7960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you've been a godly example to them, the\ngoal is that you would take them to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4970000,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eternity with you. Amen.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4974080,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So ask yourself, what is the center of\nour home? Is it Christ or is it the",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4978960,
    "dDurationMs": 9120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chaos of rushing from work to chores to\nsporting events to school work etc. Ask",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4984880,
    "dDurationMs": 9359,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yourself, are we praying together?\nAre we building our house on the rock of",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4990480,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God's word? Or are we just standing on\nthe shifting sands of surviving the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4996960,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "daily grind as much as we are able to do\nin ourselves?",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5002400,
    "dDurationMs": 8319,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's a practical challenge. Build\nspiritual rhythms",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5007199,
    "dDurationMs": 9361,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into your home. Start each week with a\nfamily devotion. sit with your kids,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5014400,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "read a passage of scripture or read a\ndevotional together, talk about how it",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5019520,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it it impacts each of their lives, and\nthen pray together. Doesn't have to take",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5025040,
    "dDurationMs": 7119,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than 10, 15 minutes, but it's a\nspiritual connecting point. And you're",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5029520,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saying to your children, this is\npriority.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5033920,
    "dDurationMs": 7759,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Jesus is center in our home. And then\npray with your spouse. If it's even a",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5039520,
    "dDurationMs": 12400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "minute every day,\npray over your spouse every day",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5045679,
    "dDurationMs": 13361,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e and make Sunday worship nonnegotiable.\nWe as a family go to church on Sunday.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5056639,
    "dDurationMs": 7441,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, but mom, I don't feel you live under\nmy house, under my roof. You eat my",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5062400,
    "dDurationMs": 8799,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "food.\n\u003e\u003e We go to church on Sunday. Hallelujah.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5068960,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you do if they they on on Monday\nmorning they I just don't feel like",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5073040,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to church going to school? I just\nwant to hang out. I want to play video.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5076719,
    "dDurationMs": 8321,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, no, no, no, no.\n\u003e\u003e You're going to school.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5081679,
    "dDurationMs": 10241,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Am I right?\n\u003e\u003e Well, serving God is a greater priority",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5089040,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than going to school. Amen.\n\u003e\u003e Their education will serve a temporary",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5094159,
    "dDurationMs": 8721,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "purpose. their spiritual life will serve\nan eternal purpose much more important.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5100719,
    "dDurationMs": 7681,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let Jesus not just be present in your\nhome. Let him be the center of your",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5106000,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "home. The strength of your home doesn't\ncome from how much you earn or or or",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5110639,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what parenting book you read. It comes\nfrom who's at the center and what you're",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5115199,
    "dDurationMs": 7121,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "building on. And when God lays the\nfoundation, when his word is the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5119440,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "foundation, your family has a future\nthat's worth fighting for. Amen.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5125679,
    "dDurationMs": 7761,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second principle, when we ignore the\ndesigner, the home becomes fragile.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5130560,
    "dDurationMs": 9200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Matthew 19:8, Moses permitted divorce\nonly as a concession to your hard",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5136880,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hearts. Basically, this was not God's\ndesign.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5141600,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was because you hardened your heart\nagainst God. Jesus went on to say, but",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5146480,
    "dDurationMs": 5199,
