    "dDurationMs": 11359,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "however, comes down simply to a battle\nfor pride.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5622320,
    "dDurationMs": 8319,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And pride is an abomination to the Lord.\nPride is what got Satan kicked out of",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5629040,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heaven.\nAnd it may be what gets you kicked out",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5632159,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your home. I mean, anyway,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5636560,
    "dDurationMs": 6639,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a true story\nabout a couple who got in an argument.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5641679,
    "dDurationMs": 6401,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They began to harden their heart and\ngive each other the silent treatment.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5644800,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this was going on for days and days.\nFinally, the husband needed to catch a",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5650560,
    "dDurationMs": 8639,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "flight for a business trip, but he\ndidn't want to break the silence first.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5656320,
    "dDurationMs": 8240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, he left a sticky note on her side of\nthe bed that said, \"Wake me up at 5:00",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5662159,
    "dDurationMs": 7441,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a.m. for the airport.\"\nThe next morning,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5666960,
    "dDurationMs": 8640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he woke up at 7:30 a.m. and he had\nmissed his flight. On his nightstand was",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5672960,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a sticky note.\nIt's 5:00 a.m. wake up.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5680000,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cuz she didn't want to break the silence\neither. Pride.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5684719,
    "dDurationMs": 7121,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what hardness of heart looks\nlike.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5687840,
    "dDurationMs": 10160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Silent wars, passive aggression.\nAnd in the end, no one wins.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5695600,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both sides lose.\nFolks, you can't change the other",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5699440,
    "dDurationMs": 7759,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person, but you can soften your heart\nbefore God and allow him to change you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5705520,
    "dDurationMs": 6159,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't wait for the other person to make\nthe first move. They're going to have to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5709360,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come to me crawling on their hands and\nknees and they're gonna",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5714400,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, that's hardness of heart.\n\u003e\u003e I see some of you laughing.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5719600,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Maybe you thought that. Amen.\nBut we make the first move. The Bible",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5724880,
    "dDurationMs": 7759,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "says if your brother,\n\u003e\u003e that means any other Christian",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5730560,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e or any other person in your life, has\nsomething against you,",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5734800,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e leave your gift at the altar\n\u003e\u003e and you go and make it right.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5741120,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e He didn't say wait for them to come to\nyou.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5742960,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That's right.\n\u003e\u003e You go make it right.",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5746560,
    "dDurationMs": 6159,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even more so when he says leave your\ngift at the altar, he's saying your",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5750400,
    "dDurationMs": 6319,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worship will not be acceptable.\n\u003e\u003e Yeah.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5753840,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until you make it right.\nHallelujah. So, some of us, you know, we",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5758960,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "haven't been talking to our spouse for a\nmonth, but we come to church.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5762560,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hallelujah.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5768320,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e God says, \"Leave that at the altar.\n\u003e\u003e Go fix your relationship and then come",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5773520,
    "dDurationMs": 8719,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back and I'll receive your worship.\"\nHallelujah. Yes. Go ahead.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5779280,
    "dDurationMs": 9200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e When we stop following God's design, the\nhome becomes like a house with a cracked",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5785679,
    "dDurationMs": 7681,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "foundation. It may stand for a while,\nbut when the storm comes,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5791120,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cracks will be weakened and the\nhouse will collapse.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5795440,
    "dDurationMs": 8719,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Jesus exposes the cracks not to\nshame us, but because he wants us to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5800960,
    "dDurationMs": 11640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "invite him to repair those cracks. And\nhe starts by saying, \"How is your heart",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5809199,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before me?\"",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5814000,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it got so quiet in here.\nWhen we're having trouble in any of our",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5818960,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relationships,\nincluding marriage,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5822880,
    "dDurationMs": 9120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it starts here.\nSo, we ask,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5827199,
    "dDurationMs": 9361,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"How is my heart before you, Lord?\"\nAmen. It's true whether we say amen or",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5835440,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not\n\u003e\u003e because Jesus said it. All right.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5839920,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Third principle. When we trust God with\nthe process, he restores the",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5843119,
    "dDurationMs": 8161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "possibility. Your past doesn't\ndisqualify your future. God can rebuild",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5848000,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what has been broken.\nJesus takes marriage seriously, but he",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5854639,
    "dDurationMs": 7841,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn't come to shame people. He came to\nhelp them and to heal them. He's not",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5860239,
    "dDurationMs": 8801,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "standing with a gavvel like a judge to\ncondemn. He's reaching out with grace",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5865600,
    "dDurationMs": 7119,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and mercy inviting you to come to him.\nAnd maybe coming to him, your marriage",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5871280,
    "dDurationMs": 6399,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is already broken. It's already gone.\nMaybe what he wants to do is heal you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5875360,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you're in a troubled relationship\nright now, maybe what he wants to do is",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5879920,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heal you and heal that relationship. But\nhe invites you to come. When he said",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5885520,
    "dDurationMs": 8159,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that divorce was not God what God\noriginally intended, he was saying it's",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5890480,
    "dDurationMs": 9840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not too late. He was saying there is\nstill hope. That means that no matter",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5896159,
    "dDurationMs": 8321,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's happened, redemption is possible.\nOne woman shared, \"I thought the affair",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5902239,
    "dDurationMs": 8241,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was the end of my story. The shame, the\nanger, the damage, it all felt final.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5907679,
    "dDurationMs": 8560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Jesus gave us a second chapter. Said\nit wasn't easy, but it was worth it.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5913679,
    "dDurationMs": 8641,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, she and her husband, they also lead\na marriage ministry, helping others walk",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5918880,
    "dDurationMs": 9040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the pain of of betrayal and hurt\nand experience God's restoration.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5925119,
    "dDurationMs": 8801,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe your story feels broken. Maybe\nyour home didn't turn out as you hoped.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5931040,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe your trust was shattered. But\nlisten, Jesus is not through with you",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5936880,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet. Jesus still writes resurrection\nstories. Amen. Maybe what he wants to do",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5942719,
    "dDurationMs": 5761,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is resurrect your hope. Maybe what he\nwants to do is resurrect your",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5946880,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relationship if you're still in that\nrelationship. Maybe what he wants to do",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5950880,
    "dDurationMs": 11600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is restore you. But when Jesus is in it,\nbroken things can be made whole. Amen.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5958719,
    "dDurationMs": 8161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Building your home on the rock makes all\nthe difference. In Matthew 7, Jesus",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5965199,
    "dDurationMs": 7121,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "said, \"Anyone who listens to my\nteaching,\"",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5969119,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and here's the important part, \"and\nfollows it.\" It's not just, \"I came to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5975520,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "church on Sunday morning, heard a good\nsermon, and said, \"Amen.\"",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5979199,
    "dDurationMs": 8561,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's it's hearing the word of God and\ngoing out and practicing it. Anyone who",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5985360,
    "dDurationMs": 8960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "listens to my teaching and follows it is\nwise. like a person who builds a house",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5990560,
    "dDurationMs": 12320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on solid rock. The rain will come, the\nwind will blow, but the house won't",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5997840,
    "dDurationMs": 8799,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fall. Amen. A home built on sand.\nJesus said, \"When the storm comes, it'll",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6004480,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fall.\" Let me tell you something. A\nhouse built on sand may look good on",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6009040,
    "dDurationMs": 7599,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instagram.\nThey're taking a trip here. They're",
