    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6014159,
    "dDurationMs": 8960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "buying a house there. They're hugging\neach other at a mo romantic date night,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6020239,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if it's not built on the rock of\nGod's word,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6025199,
    "dDurationMs": 10161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will not stand the test of time. What\nkeeps you steady isn't those",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6033040,
    "dDurationMs": 5679,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "picture worthy moments.\nWhat keeps you steady is the prayer",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6037119,
    "dDurationMs": 7441,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "closet.\nIt's the quiet obedience.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6041760,
    "dDurationMs": 7359,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the moments of self-sacrifice,\ndoing it as unto the Lord, even when",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6046719,
    "dDurationMs": 12161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not reciprocated,\nand it is the small consistent acts of",
